{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "8e00330c8c665effc83b27a7048ead6530f84411551010874b966a2592b2cc5c", "ja": "あっ、お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\nお待ちしていましたよ～！", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，{$P$}先生！\n我等您很久了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "1890bb5bf77cd2e4665dea112cbac70a9cb4e09cbfbd2efc001c474d4fc157b2", "ja": "ポップコーンとコーラの準備……じゃなかった！\n試写会の準備、バッチリできてますよ。", "zh": "爆米花和可乐的准备……不对！\n试映会的准备已经全部就绪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4941803622c48c758cf4c599b7a81b7e179a7c170f90a1bee51da61b2ec069cd", "ja": "おおっ！　ありがとうございます。助かります。\nすみません、お任せしてしまって。", "zh": "啊！谢谢，帮大忙了。\n不好意思，居然把事情都交给你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "f51200e27386455cb9573e48459ce1fc96fe833883007ed24840bcbe0abc07fd", "ja": "いえいえ！　私も楽しみで……あの名作映画の\n最新作が、一足先に見られるんですから！", "zh": "不不！我也很期待……毕竟能提前看到那部名作电影的最新作品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "b6ac0c54788a2d73062f94f9d419b91fa3f2f55dfce43e0ab3d122c3326767bf", "ja": "しかも、劇場のみんなが、全員登場するなんて……\nワクワクが止まりませんっ！", "zh": "而且，剧场里的大家竟然会全员登场……激动得根本停不下来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8d7143f9bcdfe3e5923005457d37fbd3cf48726f0afbfc702dfc3a7b7261689f", "ja": "そうですね！　今回の撮影も、みんな全身全霊で\n取り組んでくれました。いい映画になっていますよ！", "zh": "是啊！这次的拍摄，大家也都竭尽全力地\n投入其中了。一定会是一部很棒的电影！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "13190ce6b002afe17354bedfe43e38738013e72c64ac4e93242cb9a3e86e4c6f", "ja": "わぁ～、早く見たいなぁ♪　最新の映像技術を\n使ったアクションとか、見どころもたくさんって……！", "zh": "哇～，好想快点看到啊♪　听说运用了最新的影像技术制作动作戏，看点也非常多……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1007_president", "source_sha256": "acf1f0982aafb628af193d00d20ff7a8333e2eb240afa9cc5cf7387b6ce7e2cf", "ja": "その通り！　だが、アイドルスペースウォーズの\n魅力は、それだけではないよ、青羽君！", "zh": "正是如此！不过，偶像太空战争的  \n魅力还不止这些哦，青羽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "9147b4533214be0cd9c40d5fd61eff1650b61806b3aa9e7c3a3295ecfaecef0e", "ja": "あっ、社長さん！", "zh": "啊，社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "b5cddbbd271ca94d649743cc4388abe430564a4c4379614684d94c49d4faf28b", "ja": "壮大な構想から紡ぎ出される、スペースオペラ……。\nその物語世界のスケールは圧巻だ！", "zh": "由宏大构想编织而成的太空歌剧……\n其故事世界的规模令人叹为观止！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1010_president", "source_sha256": "89dfd4c5ad4c21f6c4f7d6846eb433af7fb254a4d5749c5b780065f3e9a7845f", "ja": "だが同時に、キャラクターたちの\nそれぞれの思惑が交差する、人間的な群像劇でもある！", "zh": "但与此同时，这也是一部人物各怀心思、彼此交错的人性群像剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1011_president", "source_sha256": "6db06c87b5fd162829520cfecb7996861f336a7b9fb91d9122d68b90532c139a", "ja": "それは大胆、かつ繊細……\nまさしく、超銀河級のスペクタクルなのだよ！", "zh": "那大胆而又细腻……\n正是超银河级的壮观场面啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "245e254bdd81e7502ad09fe9d96a8a48d4efbf0748678aa53f4dc43b905f7465", "ja": "な、なるほど～！　ごくり……。", "zh": "原、原来如此～！咕咚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "a7ea12a0455a90943afb1d06c7eb1702b35412b2ff4b4d6643e2163d09cecf31", "ja": "社長、社長。いきなり語りすぎです。\nほら、美咲ちゃん、困ってるじゃないですか。", "zh": "社长，社长。您一上来就说太多了。\n您看，美咲都不知所措了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "f8032365e2d8aa788363b6824aab45532afa555244f57f4d379ac8577fd22e38", "ja": "おっと、すまないね。\nつい、スイッチが入ってしまって……。", "zh": "哎呀，抱歉啊。\n一不小心就来劲了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "0e933972a7918bfdda8774e56099390b8696dec3755e1b9898711cb624f727f4", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れさまです。\n社長、今日はいつにもまして前のめりですね。", "zh": "两位，辛苦了。\n社长，您今天比平时还要积极呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "deaaba891411cc7358d775a62b07eceba34eb677f5f999c53e151e34195fad21", "ja": "ああ、楽しみでしょうがなくてね！\n早くアイドル諸君の勇姿を、この目で見たいよ。", "zh": "啊，真是期待得不得了！\n我已经迫不及待想亲眼看看各位偶像的英姿了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b24a1d7febfa077aad6776d87ddc459a6a3124e76d5f4bbe853a8d00963522dc", "ja": "それじゃあ社長たちは、先に行っててください。\n俺はメインキャストを連れて行きますから。", "zh": "那么社长你们先过去吧。\n我会带主要演员过去的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "f60c80a1b06e83082b0a10ea829200e72d9263ad63fd78757fcdc0c294166b3a", "ja": "うむ、わかった！\nでは移動しようか、青羽君、音無君。", "zh": "嗯，明白了！\n那我们出发吧，青羽君、音无君。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1019_102mis", "source_sha256": "65c87522f1c11fe9d4916350402c2791aebb3489afbe7fe0c74d255421d70451", "ja": "はい！　あの、社長さんと音無先輩は、\n原作って読まれてます？　私、まだなんですけど。", "zh": "好的！那个……社长和音无前辈，你们读过原作吗？我还没读呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1020_101kot", "source_sha256": "c09ae37d74df1d8d405359fefe969eefe692f0866319dc25a8d42d21174d5c41", "ja": "もちろん！　前作までのエピソードは、まだ原作の\n冒頭に過ぎないわ。人類がエイリアン軍と遭遇して……", "zh": "当然看了！在前作之前的剧情，还只是原作的\n开端而已呢。人类与外星人军团相遇，然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "daf18a568c78c224e02f831b4d9333a1e14e2faa3e51f7c51be05c404880e0fe", "ja": "そこから始まる、長い長い戦いの物語……\nだけど中には、種族を越えた友情に目覚める人も……？", "zh": "故事就从那里开始，展开一场漫长、漫长的战斗……\n不过，也有人觉醒了跨越种族的友情……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "5e4cac24df9a46e97ae2087bc1b78a4689f6c9a14e1e10bf8584d8100e2649ab", "ja": "音無君！　スイッチ、入っちゃってるよ！", "zh": "音无！你已经打开开关了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "1ad15c61de19e0db5b53ccc861835f62e6ca192f71a7d2e08d46b332d31153ca", "ja": "はっ！？", "zh": "啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "1813595621245b8179fe1b02e5b3a204c0bc19efa28c6087bbe8142010ea8ffa", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお疲れさまです。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b76976b04e22ef9c0f0a3efe6819e81f285aac8b082a1bb519bf8436138a31ae", "ja": "みんな揃ってるな？　待たせて悪かった。\n試写会の準備ができたから、一緒に行こう。", "zh": "大家都到齐了吧？不好意思让你们久等了。\n试映会准备好了，我们一起去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "ebf6b27b2ad59374e0370d397731513da50731c5da129a8156ce4d4ccd348075", "ja": "待ちかねたわ！　今回は手応えあったし、\n大スクリーンで自分の活躍を観るのが楽しみよ♪", "zh": "我都等不及了！这次演得挺有底气的，\n好期待在大银幕上看到自己的活跃表现呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1027_035hin", "source_sha256": "f7e3b7eb5243bad837e84f60691da3558dd16657c801bc1e18f0715459cff9fc", "ja": "あたしはドキドキだべさ……。難しい役だったけれど\nちゃんとお芝居、できてただろうか？", "zh": "我紧张得心怦怦跳呢……虽然是个很难演的角色，\n但我应该有好好演出来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "0828a5f462db03ab8581e25c50d621af7bef520e6770e7601067cf39e75cc461", "ja": "そうね。大変な撮影だった。でも全員がベストを\n尽くしたのだから、悪い結果にはならないと思うわ。", "zh": "是啊。拍摄过程很辛苦。不过，既然大家都竭尽全力了，我想结果不会差。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1029_021mat", "source_sha256": "22b6e4c44e81acd8f1c9e9b83ce2ca662876bbf40b42c2a6bab764ed42112d44", "ja": "もちろんなのです♪　姫と朋花ちゃんの悪役コンビも、\n監督さんにすごーくほめられたのですよ♪", "zh": "那是当然的哦♪　公主和朋花的反派组合，\n也受到了导演的大～大夸奖呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "a1844ae6ce7f1be5389ea35ffdc0dc5afdc832dde7d930136f4c8385ea72f943", "ja": "畏怖の視線を浴びるのも、悪くないものですね～。\nこちらも、納得のいくお芝居ができました～。", "zh": "沐浴在敬畏的目光中，感觉也挺不错的呢～  \n这边也演出了令人满意的戏剧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "803ce7db32287f4cc67f8978424b24d78b5ba9fa5028f12a87c0f88d3643fca9", "ja": "ああ、きっとたくさんの人に楽しんで貰えると思うよ。\nさあ、頑張った結果を見届けに行こう！", "zh": "啊，我想一定能让很多人享受到这场演出。\n走吧，一起去看看努力的成果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
